{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>psychological horror experience created by a team of 5 developers over the course of 4 months</strong>, featuring<strong> puzzles, immersion, and a unique hand-drawn art style.\u00a0</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647220/extras/Kitchen.png?t=1744310514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you\u00a0navigate a snowy cabin. Following a story between a Husband and Wife. Uncovering environmental clues and experiencing an unsettling atmosphere, and quickly realize something is very wrong.\u00a0The game leverages tense sound design, dynamic lighting, and eerie visual distortions to create a sense of dread. The game is designed to make the player feel disturbed and unsettled.\u00a0<br><strong>\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647220/extras/DarkLivingRoom.png?t=1744310514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To emphasize the surreal atmosphere, the radio messages are delivered through an <strong>intentionally robotic voice</strong>, this was a design choice to help emphasize the uncanny feeling the game can have at certain points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647220/extras/Couch.png?t=1744310514\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647220?t=1744310514","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647220/f364566fb16fccf184f0b05f60545b47e0ab836e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744310514","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647220/d87b943ac97ec7b49adf446850bc424016dcb7a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744310514","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647220/d87b943ac97ec7b49adf446850bc424016dcb7a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744310514","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"References to trauma and psychological disorders"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>psychological horror experience created by a team of 5 developers over the course of 4 months</strong>, featuring<strong> puzzles, immersion, and a unique hand-drawn art style.\u00a0</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647220/extras/Kitchen.png?t=1744310514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you\u00a0navigate a snowy cabin. Following a story between a Husband and Wife. Uncovering environmental clues and experiencing an unsettling atmosphere, and quickly realize something is very wrong.\u00a0The game leverages tense sound design, dynamic lighting, and eerie visual distortions to create a sense of dread. The game is designed to make the player feel disturbed and unsettled.\u00a0<br><strong>\u00a0</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647220/extras/DarkLivingRoom.png?t=1744310514\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To emphasize the surreal atmosphere, the radio messages are delivered through an <strong>intentionally robotic voice</strong>, this was a design choice to help emphasize the uncanny feeling the game can have at certain points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647220/extras/Couch.png?t=1744310514\" /></p>","developers":["Ryphil","NoV8rs","Kickycaptain","Qi Liu","Abby Jones"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647220/83541d37a64b0478244ced7bdb6d3e528b15237f/head